  ('Coffee & Lunch Social at the Christ Church', 'Every Friday from 10:30am to 12:30pm at Christ Church Gabriola. This is a great time for our community to get together. The soup and desserts are always amazing and each week we have musicians to entertain us. A non-religious event. Also supported by PHC', '2027-01-22'::date, '2027-01-22'::date, '10:30:00'::time, '12:30:00'::time, false, 'Christ Church', 'Christ Church', '2600 South Road', 'Gabriola Island', NULL, NULL, 'Gabriola Events directory', 'https://directory.gabriolaevents.ca/gabriola-events/Details/coffee-lunch-social-at-the-christ-church-1903263', true),
