  ('Adult Day Program (PHC)', 'Provides engaging therapeutic activities for individuals experiencing physical, cognitive or social challenges in a safe, supervised environment. Our person-centered programs are developed to offer an opportunity for participants to connect with each other, while also offering respite for caregivers. Dates: Mondays and Fridays, 11:30am-2:30pm. Location: Rollo Seniors Centre, 685 North Rd. Age: 60+ (flexible). Cost: FREE or by donation. Registration required. Participants must complete an Island Health intake assessment. For any questions, please contact seniorsmanager@phcgabriola.org', '2027-01-25'::date, '2027-01-25'::date, '11:30:00'::time, '14:30:00'::time, false, 'Rollo Centre', 'Rollo Centre', '685 North Road', 'Gabriola Island', NULL, NULL, 'Gabriola Events directory', 'https://directory.gabriolaevents.ca/gabriola-events/Details/adult-day-program-phc-1884597', true),
